<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African March trade data due out later this week.</title>
<headline>S.African March trade data due out later this week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>March trade data would be released either on Thursday or Friday, a Customs and Excise spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The data had been tentatively scheduled for release on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A Reuters consensus poll of economists forecast the trade balance would swing to a 730 million rand surplus in March from a 450 million rand deficit in February.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
